ian positions in Kharkiv Oblast.","side":"Russia (official)","color":"#E00000","date":"2026-10-21","time_utc":"2026-10-21T03:32:01+00:00","coords":[36.40806077098801,49.642591501998865],"precision":"oblast (centre)","loc":"region","place":"Kharkiv Oblast","evidence":"video in the post","link":"https://t.me/mod_russia/68384","sources":[],"post_text":"💥 «Северный» гром\nЭкипажи танков Т-80БВМ группировки «Север» уничтожили позиции боевиков ВСУ.\n📍 Харьковская область\n🔹 Канал Минобороны России в MAКС – источник мощных новостей","media_ratio_pct":100.0,"media_too_big":false,"key":"ru_mod:68384#0"}],"possible_matches":[],"media":[{"url":"https://t.me/mod_russia/68384","platform":"tg","id":"mod_russia/68384","kind":"video","too_big":false,"ratio_pct":100.0,"from":"Ministry of Defence of Russia","found_by":"linked by the source"}]}},{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[36.0,53.0]},"properties":{"source":"events","source_name":"Events","id":"ev-5e1bb7f0fe","date":"2026-10-21","time_utc":"2026-10-21T05:47:36+00:00","category":"Air-defence interception","categories":["Air-defence interception"],"claim":"Russian air defence forces intercepted and destroyed 373 Ukrainian fixed-wing UAVs overnight over multiple Russian regions, Crimea, and the Black Sea.","side":"Russia (official)","color":"#E00000","confidence":"low","confidence_reason":"text only","location":"place","precision":"place (AI estimate)","place":"Black Sea","claim_sources":["ru_mod"],"claims":[{"source":"ru_mod","source_name":"Ministry of Defence of Russia","kind":"official claim","category":"Air-defence interception","claim":"Russian air defence forces intercepted and destroyed 373 Ukrainian fixed-wing UAVs overnight over multiple Russian regions, Crimea, and the Black Sea.","side":"Russia (official)","color":"#E00000","date":"2026-10-21","time_utc":"2026-10-21T05:47:36+00:00","coords":[36.0,53.0],"precision":"place (AI estimate)","loc":"place","place":"Black Sea","evidence":"text only","link":"https://t.me/mod_russia/68386","sources":[],"post_text":"⚡️ В течение прошедшей ночи, с 20.00 мск 20 октября до 8.00 мск 21 октября, дежурными силами ПВО перехвачены и уничтожены 373 украинских беспилотных летательных аппарата самолетного типа над территориями Новгородской, Тверской, Брянской, Белгородской, Курской, Смоленской, Калужской, Орловской, Тульской, Рязанской областей, Московского региона, Краснодарского края, Республики Крым и над акваторией Черного моря.\n🔹 MAКС – территория СВОих","media_ratio_pct":null,"media_too_big":false,"key":"ru_mod:68386#0"}],"possible_matches":[],"media":[]}},{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[30.61451,50.40204]},"properties":{"source":"events","source_name":"Events","id":"ev-732c0396cf","date":"2026-10-21","time_utc":"2026-10-21T05:18:50+00:00","category":"Infrastructure strike","categories":["Infrastructure strike"],"claim":"Russian forces struck the Nivki 330 kV electrical substation in Kyiv supporting military-industrial enterprises and logistics centres.","side":"Russia (official)","color":"#E00000","confidence":"low","confidence_reason":"text only","location":"place","precision":"settlement","place":"Kyiv (City, Kyiv raion, Kyiv)","claim_sources":["ru_mod"],"claims":[{"source":"ru_mod","source_name":"Ministry of Defence of Russia","kind":"official claim","category":"Infrastructure strike","claim":"Russian forces struck the Nivki 330 kV electrical substation in Kyiv supporting military-industrial enterprises and logistics centres.","side":"Russia (official)","color":"#E00000","date":"2026-10-21","time_utc":"2026-10-21T05:18:50+00:00","coords":[30.61451,50.40204],"precision":"settlement","loc":"place","place":"Kyiv (City, Kyiv raion, Kyiv)","evidence":"text only","link":"https://t.me/mod_russia/68385","sources":[],"post_text":"❗️ Сегодня ночью Вооруженными Силами Российской Федерации нанесены удары беспилотными летательными аппаратами по логистическим центрам, портовой инфраструктуре Украины и э